{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02581","headline":"中妇织流黄 · 虞世南","name":"中妇织流黄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒闺织素锦，含怨敛双蛾。\n综新交缕澁，经脆断丝多。\n衣香逐举袖，钏动应鸣梭。\n还恐裁缝罢，无信达交河。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}